## Cohesion Audit: `src/blog/people/drafts/Arthur-Mensch.md`

### Central Thesis
Arthur Mensch is a Type 6 whose entire career is one move repeated at every scale — converting arrangements someone else can revoke into ground nobody can take back — which is why the man who says AI models are easy to build raised €3B to own the physical layer and gave the models away.

